# In Search of Cloth (Q034): a level 60 character whose formal wear (Q037) is at its sixth step
# accepts at Radia, sees Varan and Radia again, then Ralford, kills trisalim spiders for ten
# spinnerets (every drop roll pinned to land; the tenth moves the quest on), has Ralford spin them
# into spider silk, and Radia weaves the silk, three thousand suede and five thousand threads into
# a mysterious cloth and the quest completes; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace
# of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q034_in_search_of_cloth.golden
character Weaver 60
quest Q037_MakeFormalWear <cond>=6 <state>=STARTED
hold 1866 3000
hold 1868 5000
random always 0
script quest.Q034_InSearchOfCloth
script quest.Q037_MakeFormalWear
item 7528 1866 1868 7161 7076
page merchant/30088.htm
page merchant/30165.htm
page merchant/30294.htm
page script/quest/Q034_InSearchOfCloth/
npc radia 30088 Merchant 10 0 0
npc ralford 30165 Merchant 20 0 0
npc varan 30294 Merchant -20 0 0
npc spider 20560 Monster 0 40 0

# Radia: accept.
action radia
action radia
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=radia item=0 page=merchant/30088.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{radia}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=radia item=0 page=script/quest/Q034_InSearchOfCloth/30088-0.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  state Q034_InSearchOfCloth CREATED
bypass Quest Q034_InSearchOfCloth 30088-1.htm
  S QuestList 37:0x8000003f 34:0x80000001
  S ExShowQuestMark quest=34
  S PlaySound type=0 file=ItemSound.quest_accept bind=0 obj=0 loc=0,0,0 delay=0
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=radia item=0 page=script/quest/Q034_InSearchOfCloth/30088-1.htm
  S ActionFailed
  Q upsert Q034_InSearchOfCloth | <state> | STARTED
  Q upsert Q034_InSearchOfCloth | <cond> | 1
  state Q034_InSearchOfCloth STARTED
  rows Q034_InSearchOfCloth <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED
action radia
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=radia item=0 page=merchant/30088.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{radia}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=radia item=0 page=script/quest/Q034_InSearchOfCloth/30088-1a.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed

